        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Streamstown House, Streamstown, Co. Westmeath N91 AY72\nFor Sale By Private Treaty\n\nHorseleap 6km - Kilbeggan 12km - M6 13km - Tullamore 24km - Dublin City 104km - Dublin Airport 112km\n\nDescription\nStreamstown House is a two-storey over basement period country residence which has been sensitively refurbished by its present owners, including re-wiring, re-plumbing, and roofing. Extending to c. 8,476 sq.ft. this charming family home has an array of period features, including fireplaces, coving and ceiling centre-pieces, offering a purchaser a home of true character and charm.\n\nAccessed via a gated entrance and driveway with the house situated in an elevated position well off the road and providing scenic views of the surrounding lands.\n\nThe accommodation briefly includes entrance porch, hall, living room, dining room, kitchen, rear reception and guest wc on the ground floor, 5 bedrooms (2 en-suite) including a large principle bedroom suite with dressing room all on the upper floor. The basement area includes a kitchen, living room, bedroom, bathroom, games room, pump room and separate access to the rear. There is also an extensive attic area ideal for storage.\n\nOutside there is a triple garage and a private walled garden.\n\nLands\nThe lands themselves extend to a total c.86.50 acres with the majority in grass and suitable for a variety of uses along with some mature trees and hedgerows.\n\nServices\nPrivate water, septic tank, electricity (including 3 phase), heat pump, broadband.\n\nAmenities\nThere are a number of primary and secondary schools nearby whilst the local village of Horseleap and the town of Kinnegad provide shopping, pubs, restaurants and sports clubs. The Kilbeggan Distillery and Racecourse are two of the major local attractions, while the nearby Lough Ennel is popular for fishing and water sports.\n\nSolicitor\nMs. Vivienne Kelly, Flynn O'Driscoll Solicitors, 1 Grants Row, Lower Mount Street, Dublin 2, D02 HX96.\n\nDirections\nEircode N91 AY72\n\nViewing\nStrictly by prior appointment only with the sole selling agents."
